        "answer": {
          "short": "$6.5$",
          "worked": "The 2nd significant digit is $4$, in the tenths place. The next digit is $8$.\n$$6.48\\approx6.5\\quad(2\\text{ s.f.})$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 14
