        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.65$",
          "worked": "The 2nd significant digit is $4$, in the hundredths place. The next digit is $8$.\n$$0.648\\approx0.65\\quad(2\\text{ s.f.})$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
